{"id":"2ab8bcd7b57a9c4e","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-tree9-perfect-kernel-tree.md","title":"ZFC Tree9 Perfect Kernel Tree","display":"df-zfc-tree9-perfect-kernel-tree — ZFC Tree9 Perfect Kernel Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree9-perfect-kernel-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree9-perfect-kernel-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-tree9-perfect-kernel-tree — ZFC Tree9 Perfect Kernel Tree","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-tree10-perfect-subtree.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree9-perfect-kernel-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree9-perfect-kernel-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree9-perfect-kernel-tree — ZFC Tree9 Perfect Kernel Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6f4850acf79db53d\" href=\"?note=6f4850acf79db53d\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-tree10-perfect-subtree.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-tree10-perfect-subtree.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,T\\in V\">\\(K,T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10PerfectSubtree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10PerfectSubtree}_S\\)</span> (perfect-subtree predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9PerfectKernelTree}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree9PerfectKernelTree}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree9PerfectKernelTree}_S(K,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nK=\n\\bigcup\\left\\{\nS\\subseteq T:\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10PerfectSubtree}_S(S,T)\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree9PerfectKernelTree}_S(K,T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nK=\n\\bigcup\\left\\{\nS\\subseteq T:\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10PerfectSubtree}_S(S,T)\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The kernel is the union of all perfect subtrees of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>, hence the largest\nperfect subtree; the empty union handles trees with no perfect part.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-tree10-perfect-subtree.md","status":"resolved","id":"6f4850acf79db53d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-tree10-perfect-subtree.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10PerfectSubtree}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9PerfectKernelTree}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree9\\text{-}perfect\\text{-}kernel\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree9PerfectKernelTree}_S(K,T)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\nK=\n\\bigcup\\left\\{\nS\\subseteq T:\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10PerfectSubtree}_S(S,T)\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1043,"backlinks":[{"id":"d5508d9e1e2a1ed8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3837","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-tree9-perfect-kernel-tree.md|58-df-zfc-tree9-perfect-kernel-tree]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","6f4850acf79db53d"]}